   {
    "pil": "FLSMTR",
    "text": "572 \nWGUS86 KMTR 250958\nFLSMTR\n\nFlood Advisory\nNational Weather Service San Francisco CA\n158 AM PST Wed Nov 25 2026\n\nCAC075-251008-\n/O.EXP.KMTR.FA.Y.0058.000000T0000Z-261125T1000Z/\n/00000.N.ER.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.OO/\nSan Francisco CA-\n158 AM PST Wed Nov 25 2026\n\n...FLOOD ADVISORY WILL EXPIRE AT 2 AM PST EARLY THIS MORNING...\n\nThe Flood Advisory will expire at 2 AM PST early this morning for a\nportion of northern California, including the following area, San\nFrancisco.\n\nThe heavy rain has ended. Urban area flooding is no longer expected\nto pose a threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.\n\n&&\n\nLAT...LON 3778 12252 3779 12249 3781 12248 3781 12241\n      3779 12239 3775 12238 3775 12239 3774 12238\n      3773 12238 3773 12236 3772 12236 3772 12239\n      3771 12238 3771 12250\n\n\n$$\n\nKR\n\n\u0003"
