   {
    "pil": "FLSMTR",
    "text": "387 \nWGUS86 KMTR 250836\nFLSMTR\n\nFlood Advisory\nNational Weather Service San Francisco CA\n1236 AM PST Wed Nov 25 2026\n\nCAC041-097-250846-\n/O.EXP.KMTR.FA.Y.0057.000000T0000Z-261125T0845Z/\n/00000.N.ER.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.OO/\nMarin CA-Sonoma CA-\n1236 AM PST Wed Nov 25 2026\n\n...FLOOD ADVISORY WILL EXPIRE AT 1245 AM PST EARLY THIS MORNING...\n\nThe Flood Advisory will expire at 1245 AM PST early this morning for\na portion of northern California, including the following areas,\nMarin and Sonoma.\n\nThe heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a\nthreat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.\n\n&&\n\nLAT...LON 3845 12313 3859 12307 3865 12266 3857 12263\n      3856 12261 3827 12244 3792 12272 3801 12285\n      3803 12293 3803 12289 3809 12293 3806 12295\n      3808 12296 3806 12296 3799 12302 3815 12295\n      3822 12298 3808 12283 3809 12283\n\n\n$$\n\nSarment\n\n\u0003"
