   {
    "pil": "FLSMTR",
    "text": "812 \nWGUS86 KMTR 250548\nFLSMTR\n\nFlood Advisory\nNational Weather Service San Francisco CA\n948 PM PST Tue Nov 24 2026\n\nCAC041-097-250845-\n/O.NEW.KMTR.FA.Y.0057.261125T0548Z-261125T0845Z/\n/00000.N.ER.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.000000T0000Z.OO/\nMarin CA-Sonoma CA-\n948 PM PST Tue Nov 24 2026\n\n...FLOOD ADVISORY IN EFFECT UNTIL 1245 AM PST WEDNESDAY...\n\n* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.\n\n* WHERE...Marin County in northern California...\n  Central Sonoma County in northern California...\n\n* WHEN...Until 1245 AM PST.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\n  Ponding of water in urban or other areas is occurring or is\n  imminent.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n  - At 948 PM PST, Doppler radar indicated heavy rain. Minor flooding\n    is ongoing or expected to begin shortly in the advisory area.\n    Between 0.2 and 1.5 inches of rain have fallen over the last 3\n    hours with additional training rainfall expected over this area.\n  - Some locations that will experience flooding include...\n    Santa Rosa, Petaluma, Novato, Rohnert Park, Windsor, Healdsburg,\n    Sonoma, Sebastopol, Cotati, South Santa Rosa Cdp, Roseland,\n    Tomales, Larkfield-Wikiup, Dillon Beach, Point Reyes Station,\n    Boyes Hot Springs, San Geronimo, Forestville and Guerneville.\n  - http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood\n\nPRECAUTIONARY/PREPAREDNESS ACTIONS...\n\nTurn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood\ndeaths occur in vehicles.\n\nBe especially cautious at night when it is harder to recognize the\ndangers of flooding.\n\nPlease report observed flooding to local emergency services or law\nenforcement and request they pass this information to the National\nWeather Service when you can do so safely.\n\n&&\n\nLAT...LON 3845 12313 3859 12307 3865 12266 3857 12263\n      3856 12261 3827 12244 3792 12272 3801 12285\n      3803 12293 3803 12289 3809 12293 3806 12295\n      3808 12296 3806 12296 3799 12302 3815 12295\n      3822 12298 3808 12283 3809 12283\n\n\n$$\n\nKennedy\n\n\u0003"
